# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# LiveBridge — example environment configuration (Vite)
# Copy this file to .env and adjust values for your machine.
# Variables prefixed with VITE_ are exposed to the client code.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# WebSocket signaling server used by Connect mode (WebRTC handshake).
# Local default: ws://localhost:3001
# On another machine: ws://<server-ip>:3001
VITE_SIGNALING_URL=ws://localhost:3001

# NOTE: the following services use fixed local endpoints (see README):
#   - Ollama LLM ......... http://localhost:11434   (aiService / emotionService)
#   - Voice Assistant .... http://localhost:5000/search  (server/search-api.js)
